1
00:04:41,739 --> 00:04:47,739
There is nothing more human than the will to survive.

2
00:09:23,478 --> 00:09:29,478
Ex Machina is a drama, science fiction film directed by Alex Garland.

3
00:14:05,217 --> 00:14:11,217
Caleb, a coder at the world's largest internet company, wins a competition to spend a week at a
private mountain retreat belonging to Nathan, the reclusive CEO of the company.

4
00:18:46,956 --> 00:18:52,956
But when Caleb arrives at the remote location he finds that he will have to participate in a strange and fascinating experiment in
which he must interact with the world's first true artificial intelligence, housed in the body of a beautiful robot girl.

5
00:23:28,695 --> 00:23:34,695
Caleb, played by Domhnall Gleeson.

6
00:28:10,434 --> 00:28:16,434
Ava, played by Alicia Vikander.

7
00:32:52,173 --> 00:32:58,173
Nathan, played by Oscar Isaac.

8
00:37:33,913 --> 00:37:39,913
Kyoko, played by Sonoya Mizuno.

9
00:42:15,652 --> 00:42:21,652
Jay, played by Corey Johnson.

10
00:46:57,391 --> 00:47:03,391
Lily, played by Claire Selby.

11
00:51:39,130 --> 00:51:45,130
Ex Machina is a 2014  science fiction film, written and
directed by Alex Garland in his directorial debut.

12
00:56:20,869 --> 00:56:26,869
It stars Domhnall Gleeson, Alicia Vikander, and Oscar Isaac.

13
01:01:02,608 --> 01:01:08,608
It follows a programmer who is invited by his CEO to administer the
Turing test to an intelligent female humanoid robot.

14
01:05:44,347 --> 01:05:50,347
Ex Machina premiered at the BFI Southbank on 16 December 2014.

15
01:10:26,086 --> 01:10:32,086
It was released in the United Kingdom on 21 January 2015, by Universal Pictures
International, and in the United States on 10 April 2015, by A24.

16
01:15:07,826 --> 01:15:13,826
It grossed over $36.8 million worldwide on a $15 million budget.

17
01:19:49,565 --> 01:19:55,565
Ex Machina received acclaim for its visual effects, screenplay and performances.

18
01:24:31,304 --> 01:24:37,304
At the 88th Academy Awards, it won Best Visual Effects and
Garland was nominated for Best Original Screenplay.

19
01:29:13,043 --> 01:29:19,043
It earned five nominations at the 69th British Academy Film Awards, including Best Actress in a Supporting Role for Vikander and Best
Original Screenplay for Garland, and Vikander was also nominated for Best Supporting Actress at the 73rd Golden Globe Awards.

20
01:33:54,782 --> 01:34:00,782
Ex Machina has been cited as among the best films of the 2010s.

21
01:38:36,521 --> 01:38:42,521
The film explores themes of android, dancing,
friendship, man vs machine, distrust.

22
01:43:18,260 --> 01:43:24,260
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking and intense.
